{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/279938-changeling-ideas-for-samhain","id":279938,"title":"Changeling Ideas for Samhain","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-13T11:38:22-07:00","id":279938,"title":"Changeling Ideas for Samhain","content":"It's coming up. What do you guys like to do for it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3920-sarah-rps","name":"Sarah RPs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-13T15:13:30-07:00","id":280187,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sarah RPs</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/279938-changeling-ideas-for-samhain#post279938\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's coming up. What do you guys like to do for it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Stay home like the other monsters. It's too commercial.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-13T15:17:29-07:00","id":280192,"title":"","content":"gonna run a game of AFME set in 1950's xD! havent throught of any WoD related, i would liek to include some Changelling nightmares but i lack the proper changeling knowledge to do so.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-14T01:04:37-07:00","id":280707,"title":"","content":"Give candy to kids who show up at my door with a semblance of a costume and mock the teenagers who don't.<br /> <br /> @ Crowley: Why need changeling knowledge? They are nightmares, just fly by the seat of your pants. Lots of terrors playing on the minds of people in the 50's, the cold war was in full swing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-15T10:08:11-07:00","id":282426,"title":"","content":"The cabal of my mage game is really centred around the Verbena member of the party so we always like to play on days like these to see what we can get up to. The spring equinox is their special day for life magic and it was set aside for a big ritual to try and cure a ghoul of blood bonding.<br /> <br /> This year a Verbena npc is pregnant and it looks like she is due to go into labour on Samhain. It's the holy day for Spirit on their calender so that's going to be interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Tall, dark, and loathsome","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2808-peryton","name":"Peryton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2808_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T02:07:51-08:00","id":362238,"title":"","content":"I always wondered how to handle Samhain in changeling games. it has only ever come up briefly in the online games and was sort of glossed over. As written in the Shadow Court book, all fae switch to their Unseelie Legacies and forget the events of that night by morning of the next day. This doesn't exactly elaborate on the how or why or what happens to the stability of a Kingdom in that one night. A whole lot can happen in one night and if no one remembers, well then how does a kingdom pick up the pieces if somehow their ruler disappeared? or what about places that don't celebrate Samhain but they do have their own night where the spirit world is close and they revere their dead? Does the night of forgetfulness apply or all the Kith? Even those like Nunnehi or the Selkies? While the fiction novels are not considered Cannon, quite a few of the stories completely ignore the forgetfulness accompanying the holiday and present it in a more traditional ritual night that actually makes a lot more sense in the context of nearness to freeholds and shelter from the madness that happens on October 31. I might not be doing much for Halloween (working,) but every year I have these questions when it comes to Changeling. So Sarah, How would you handle it if you were running a Changeling game on Samhain night? (actual night or in game night)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}